This repository demonstrates NakodaX Source Protection. The LedgerLens sample
application it contains is distributed encrypted. The launcher scripts, the
documentation and the trial key are readable.

Anyone may, using the trial key in this repository or a key issued by Nakodax:
  - clone, store and run this repository on their own machines;
  - run, inspect the output of, and evaluate the sample application.

You may not, without a written agreement with Nakodax:
  - copy, modify, redistribute or build derivative works from the decrypted
    sample application;
  - use the contents to train or evaluate machine-learning systems;
  - remove, bypass or tamper with the licence checks or the encryption.

Nakodax may disable the trial key at any time.

